# 止蝕
(pos:動詞)
<explanation>
yue:唔使再繼續做一件事（通常係指唔使再浪費時間、金錢或精力喺某件無用嘅事）
eng:to stop doing something (usually something that is no longer worthwhile)
<eg>
yue:呢本書好無聊，我決定止蝕，唔使再讀下去。 (ni1 bun2 syu2 hou2 mou5 lau4, ngo5 kyut3 ceon4 stop3, m4 m4 sai3 zaa3 hei3 hei3.)
eng:This book is so boring, I decided to stop reading it and not continue.

<eg>
yue:呢個生意做咗咗就夠，止蝕得好。 (ni1 go4 sing1 yi3 zou2 zo3 zo3 gau3, stop3 dou3 hou2.)
eng:We've made enough from this business, it's good to stop while we're ahead. [end of text]


